  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TAX for Sustainable Development Goals in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project seeks to bring together Rwanda&#x2019;s national priorities on financing for development and the Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), with a specific focus on taxation. It is demand-driven and focuses on support to the Rwanda Revenue Authority (RRA), which is the central authority for articulating national administrative requirements on taxation and development in Rwanda to foster systemic reforms and institutional development.</narrative>
  </description>
